id: 22
hanzi: 背景
pinyin: bèi jǐng
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: background; backdrop; context; social/family connections
  es: fondo; telón de fondo; contexto; antecedentes personales; respaldo

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | the scenery or ground behind the main object in a picture, stage, or view; backdrop | paisaje, decorado o parte posterior sobre la que destaca la figura principal de una pintura, foto o escenario | 照片背景 (photo background)
  2 | Noun | Standard | the historical context, cultural milieu, or personal social connections underlying an event or individual | contexto histórico, entorno cultural o antecedentes personales y familiares que rodean un hecho | 时代背景 (historical background / context of the era)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 在全球智能手机全面爆发的历史背景下，微信抓住了移动互联网转型浪潮，迅速完成了海外多语言布局。 | Zài quánqiú zhìnéng shǒujī quánmiàn bàofā de lìshǐ bèijǐng xià, Wēixìn zhuāzhùle yídòng hùliánwǎng zhuǎnxíng làngcháo, xùnsù wánchéngle hǎiwài duōyǔyán bùjú. | Against the historical backdrop of global smartphone explosion, WeChat seized the mobile internet transition wave, quickly completing its multilingual overseas layout. | Con el auge de los móviles como telón de fondo, WeChat aprovechó la ola digital completando con presteza su despliegue multilingüe internacional.
  #2 | 在面试新员工时，企业管理者不仅看重应聘者的学术教育背景，更关注其在跨文化团队中的协作沟通能力。 | Zài miànshì xīn yuángōng shí, qǐyè guǎnlǐzhě bùjǐn kànzhòng yìngpìnzhě de xuéshù jiàoyù bèijǐng, gèng guānzhù qí zài kuàwénhuà tuánduì zhōng de xiézuò gōutōng nénglì. | When interviewing new recruits, managers value not only candidates' academic education background, but even more their communication skills in multicultural teams. | Al entrevistar a candidatos, los directivos valoran su formación académica, pero priorizan su capacidad de comunicación en equipos multiculturales.

