    后 | hòu | back; rear
    境 | jìng | milieu; border
    象 | xiàng | image; phenomenon

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 背景 encompasses the physical backdrop of visual imagery, as well as the historical, socioeconomic context or personal pedigree.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 背景 vs. 环境 | huánjìng | 环境 refers to surrounding physical ecological conditions or social atmosphere ('生活环境', '生态环境'), whereas 背景 focuses on underlying historical backdrop or pedigree.
    2 | 背景 vs. 情景 | qíngjǐng | 情景 describes a specific dynamic scene or dramatic tableau unfolding before one's eyes ('感人的情景'), while 背景 is the static context behind it.
    3 | 背景 vs. 幕后 | mùhòu | 幕后 refers to behind-the-scenes confidential operations or unseen backstage masterminds ('幕后推手'), whereas 背景 is contextual setting.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 理解一部伟大的文学经典，离不开对其创作时代背景的深入考证。作家笔下栩栩如生的人物命运与悲欢离合，无不深深镌刻着特定历史时期的政治风云与社会思想烙印，展现出时代精神对个人灵魂的塑造力量。 | Lǐjiě yī bù wěidà de wénxué jīngdiǎn, líbùkāi duì qí chuàngzuò shídài bèijǐng de shēnrù kǎozhèng. Zuòjiā bǐxià xǔxǔ-rúshēng de rénwù mìngyùn yǔ bēihuān-líhé, wúbù shēndēn juānkè zhe tèdìng lìshǐ shíqī de zhèngzhì fēngyún yǔ shèhuì sīxiǎng làoyìn, zhǎnxiàn chū shídài jīngshén duì gèrén línghún de shùzào lìliang. | Understanding a literary classic is inseparable from exploring its historical context. The vivid destinies and sorrows depicted by an author are deeply stamped with political winds and social thought, showing how eras mold human souls. | Comprender un clásico literario exige ahondar en el contexto de su época. Los destinos humanos plasmados por el autor llevan la impronta de las corrientes políticas de su tiempo, reflejando cómo la historia forja el alma.
  #2 | 在经济全球化与数字化转型的宏大背景下，不同文化背景的跨国科研人员汇聚在同一个云端协同平台。大家虽然母语与习俗各异，但凭借对真理的共同执着追求，成功打破了文化偏见与思维藩篱，开创了国际学术合作的新典范。 | Zài jīngjì quánqiúhuà yǔ shùzìhuà zhuǎnxíng de hóngdà bèijǐng xià, bùtóng wénhuà bèijǐng de kuàguó kēyán rényuán huìjù zài tóng yī gè yúnduān xiétóng píngtái. Dàjiā suīrán mǔyǔ yǔ xísú gèyì, dàn píngjiè duì zhēnlǐ de gòngtóng zhízhuó zhuīqiú, chénggōng dǎpòle wénhuà piānjiàn yǔ sīwéi fānlí, kāichuàngle guójì xuéshù hézuò de xīn diǎnfàn. | Against the backdrop of globalization and digital transition, researchers from diverse cultural backgrounds unite on cloud platforms. Despite different tongues, their shared pursuit of truth breaks cultural prejudices, forging a paradigm of cooperation. | Con la globalización y la digitalización de fondo, científicos de diversos orígenes culturales coinciden en plataformas en la nube. Pese a hablar distintas lenguas, su amor a la ciencia derriba prejuicios creando un modelo de cooperación.
